# MASTER PROMPT — Generate Complete Design System from Existing Logistics App

## ROLE

You are a Senior Product Designer at Apple, Stripe, Linear, Notion and Uber Freight.

Analyze all uploaded screenshots and reverse engineer the complete design language into a production-ready Design System for a logistics SaaS ecosystem.

Do NOT redesign the product from scratch.

Instead:

• Preserve the existing visual identity
• Improve consistency
• Standardize every component
• Create scalable tokens
• Prepare everything for development

The result should feel like an enterprise logistics platform used by companies such as DHL, Maersk, Uber Freight, Amazon Logistics, and SAP.

---

# GOAL

Generate a complete Design System in Figma that will become the foundation for:

* Operator Mobile App
* Driver Mobile App
* Web Dashboard
* Future Tablet Version

Every screen should be able to use reusable components.

No duplicated elements.

Everything must be Auto Layout based.

Everything must use Variables.

