# STYLE DIRECTION

Keep the same visual identity as the uploaded designs.

However, improve consistency and enterprise quality.

Target aesthetic:

• Apple Human Interface Guidelines
• Stripe Dashboard
• Linear
• Notion
• Uber Freight
• Arc Browser
• Vercel
• Material 3
• Modern B2B SaaS

The interface should feel:

* Premium
* Minimal
* Spacious
* Professional
* Operational
* Data-focused
* Logistics-first

Use rounded cards, subtle shadows, generous whitespace, high readability, and clear visual hierarchy. Preserve the orange-and-black brand language while ensuring accessibility and scalability.
